KAs [ 26]. The areas of Computing Foundations ,Mathematical Foundations , and Engineering Foundations were excluded,
because they were considered outside the study’s scope [ 160]. Despite the V3 guide’s relatively old publication year
(2014), all of its KAs remain relevant, as can be observed from the overview of the ongoing SWEBOK V4 [ 72]. V4
consists of the same KAs, and redistributes some material to three new KAs: Software Architecture ,Software Operations ,
